/T (With the congested uplink the true upload delay is 56 ms but RTT/2 says 33 ms, a 23 ms underestimate, and it overestimates the download by the same amount \(33 vs 10 ms\). For a voice call the upload direction is what's hurting, and RTT/2 hides it. One-way delay measured with synchronised clocks \(GPS/PTP\) shows each direction separately.)
/E (With the congested uplink the true upload delay is 56 ms but RTT/2 says 33 ms, a 23 ms underestimate, and it overestimates the download by the same amount \(33 vs 10 ms\). For a voice call the upload direction is what's hurting, and RTT/2 hides it. One-way delay measured with synchronised clocks \(GPS/PTP\) shows each direction separately.)
