<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 67 0 R
/T (Repeat Run 5 and 6 in NS-3: PointToPointHelper \(2 Mbps, 10 ms\), voice as UdpClient \(200 B every 20 ms\), download as BulkSendApplication, FlowMonitor for delay/jitter/loss, and PfifoFast vs PrioQueueDisc via TrafficControlHelper. Comparison: Packet Tracer is drag-and-drop, quick to build \(about an hour\) but gives coarse results and limited statistics. NS-3 takes much longer to set up \(C++/Python, maybe half a day the first time\), but gives exact per-packet delay, jitter and loss, is scriptable and repeatable, and can run hundreds of users easily.)
/E (Repeat Run 5 and 6 in NS-3: PointToPointHelper \(2 Mbps, 10 ms\), voice as UdpClient \(200 B every 20 ms\), download as BulkSendApplication, FlowMonitor for delay/jitter/loss, and PfifoFast vs PrioQueueDisc via TrafficControlHelper. Comparison: Packet Tracer is drag-and-drop, quick to build \(about an hour\) but gives coarse results and limited statistics. NS-3 takes much longer to set up \(C++/Python, maybe half a day the first time\), but gives exact per-packet delay, jitter and loss, is scriptable and repeatable, and can run hundreds of users easily.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [44]
>>
