/Title (Easier to secure: webmail over HTTPS. One port \(443\), one TLS endpoint to harden, easy MFA/SSO, a WAF can sit in front, and no mail password stored on every student's device. IMAP clients \(IMAPS 993\) can be secure too, but there are many different clients, some still use basic passwords, and MFA is harder.)
