/Title (FTP and the firewall. FTP uses a control connection on port 21 and a separate data connection. In active mode the client sends PORT and the server opens the data connection back to the client \(from port 20 to a random client port\). That's an inbound connection, and the company firewall never saw a matching outgoing)
