/Title (SIP vs RTP: RTP only carries the voice samples, with sequence numbers and timestamps. SIP is the signalling: it registers users, finds the other party, rings \(INVITE / 180 Ringing / 200 OK / ACK\), negotiates codec and ports \(via SDP\), and ends the call \(BYE\).)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 867 0 R
/Prev 1028 0 R
>>
endobj
